      "value": "This already exists (for a group owner at least), and has existed as long as recurring Event series have.\n\nOn any individual repeating event, a link \"View Event Series\" is found that takes to the recurring Event series. When the recurring Event series is modified, all events under it get modified too.\n\nWhen an Event series is deleted, all events under it get deleted too.",
